# Deployment: Standard UI Demo

**Project:** `@no-comply/standard-ui-demo`

**Domain:** `noodlestan.org`

**Status:** `PLANNED`

**Environments:**

- **Production:** https://standard-ui-demo.noodlestan.org (bucket: `standard-ui-demo-noodlestan-org-prod`, distribution: `TBD`)
- **Staging:** https://stage-standard-ui-demo.noodlestan.org (bucket: `standard-ui-demo-noodlestan-org-stage`, distribution: `TBD`)

**Terraform:**

- $WORKSPACE/repos/terraform/domains/noodlestan/main.tf (`module "standard_ui_demo"`)
- $WORKSPACE/repos/terraform/domains/noodlestan/websites/standard-ui-demo/main.tf

**Build:**

```bash
cd $WORKSPACE/repos/no-comply/apps/standard-ui-demo
npm run build
```

**Deploy:**

Deploy to Production:

```bash
cd $WORKSPACE/repos/no-comply/apps/standard-ui-demo
aws s3 sync dist/ s3://standard-ui-demo-noodlestan-org-prod --delete
aws cloudfront create-invalidation --distribution-id TBD --paths "/*"
```

Deploy to Staging:

```bash
cd $WORKSPACE/repos/no-comply/apps/standard-ui-demo
aws s3 sync dist/ s3://standard-ui-demo-noodlestan-org-stage --delete
aws cloudfront create-invalidation --distribution-id TBD --paths "/*"
```
